<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Artificial Intelligence Overview</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>

    <br><br>

    <%- include("partials/header", {
        pageTitle: "Artificial Intelligence",
        subtitle: "Exploring the fundamentals of artificial intelligence and its applications.",
        activePage: activePage
    }) %>

    <main>
        <section>
            <h2>What is Artificial Intelligence?</h2>

            <div class="two-column">
                <div>
                    <img class="page-image" src="/img/ai-overview.jpg" alt="AI Overview">
                </div>

                <div>
                    <p>
                        Artificial Intelligence, often called AI, is a field of computer science that focuses on creating
                        computer systems that can perform tasks usually associated with human intelligence. These tasks can
                        include learning from data, recognizing patterns, understanding language, solving problems, and making
                        decisions.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        AI is important because it helps computers work with large amounts of information and find useful
                        patterns. Today, AI is used in search engines, voice assistants, recommendation systems, medical tools,
                        cybersecurity, education, and software development.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="api-box">
            <h2>Web API Data</h2>
            <p>
                This section uses the Wikipedia REST API from the backend route in <strong>index.mjs</strong>.
            </p>

            <h3><%= wikiData.title %></h3>
            <p><%= wikiData.extract %></p>

            <a href="<%= wikiData.content_urls.desktop.page %>" target="_blank">
                View Wikipedia Source
            </a>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include("partials/footer") %>

</body>
</html>